@startuml
title /advice/ai 接口调用时序

actor 用户 as User
participant "浏览器\n(JS Fetch)" as Browser
participant "Flask Router\napp/app.py" as Flask
participant "AI Advice\nModule" as AIModule
participant "DeepSeek API\n(外部服务)" as DeepSeek

User -> Browser: 查看标准建议后\n点击「AI 建议」标签
activate Browser

Browser -> Flask: POST /advice/ai\nJSON: {label, probabilities}
activate Flask

Flask -> AIModule: generate_ai_advice(label, probabilities)
activate AIModule

AIModule -> AIModule: 检查 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY

alt API Key 缺失
  AIModule --> Flask: {"error": "未配置DEEPSEEK_API_KEY"}
  Flask --> Browser: HTTP 500\n{success: false, msg: "..."}
  Browser -> Browser: AI Tab 显示错误提示
else API Key 正常
  AIModule -> DeepSeek: POST /v1/chat/completions\nAuthorization: Bearer <key>\n{model, messages, temperature, max_tokens}
  activate DeepSeek
  note right of DeepSeek
    System: 健康顾问角色
    5维度 JSON 格式约束
    User: 检测结果数据
  end note
  DeepSeek --> AIModule: {choices[0].message.content}
  deactivate DeepSeek

  AIModule -> AIModule: json.loads(content)

  alt JSON 解析成功
    AIModule -> AIModule: 校验5维度完整性\n缺项自动补全
    AIModule --> Flask: {饮食调理, 作息建议, 运动指导, 中医调理, 心理调节}
    Flask --> Browser: HTTP 200\n{success: true, advice: {ai: {...}}}
    Browser -> Browser: renderAdvice('ai', data)\nTab 切换至 AI 建议
    Browser --> User: 展示 AI 个性化建议
  else JSON 解析失败
    AIModule --> Flask: {"error": "AI返回格式异常"}
    Flask --> Browser: HTTP 500
    Browser -> Browser: AI Tab title 提示\n"AI 建议暂不可用"
  end
end

deactivate AIModule
deactivate Flask
deactivate Browser

@enduml
